===Suffix===
{{head|unm|suffix|g=in|plural|-ikaona|locative|-ikaonink|cat2=nominative suffixes}}

# {{ng|Nominal suffix designating a structure or building, often translated as "house."}}

====Usage notes====
* Often further constructed with the [[locative]] [[suffix]] {{m|unm|-ink|t=inside}} to create an adjective meaning "in," "into," "on," or "onto [the structure]."
* Note that while this is often directly translated as "house," it also broadly applies to other buildings, similar to {{cog|en|house}} when used as a suffix.

