Page 611 -mënshi: -------- begin text --------

===Etymology===
Inherited from {{inh|unm|alg-pro|*-eminšy|t=plant}}.

===Root===
{{head|unm|root|g=an|g2=in|plural inanimate|-mënshia|plural animate|-mënshiàk}}

# [[plant]]; [[tree]] {{q|usually used to denote the plant producing a seed, fruit or berry etc. rather than the produced seed itself}}

====Usage notes====
* While terms for plants in Unami are generally animate, the plural is in the inanimate. As such, it is not consistent which animacy class derived nouns fall into.
* The inanimate suffix is likely a remnant from the {{cog|alg-pro|*-eminšya}}, which was animate (see {{m|alg-pro|*aʔsena·minšya}}) but more closely resembles Unami's inanimate plural.

