===Etymology===
From {{inh|unm|alg-pro|*wenči||whence, from, because}}.

===Particle===
{{head|unm|particle}}

# [[from]], from such a place
#: {{usex|unm|Tàxën luwàneyunk '''wënchi'''.|There is a cold wind '''from''' the north.}}
#: {{usex|unm|Osi hàkink '''wënchi''' pe na awèn.|That person came '''from''' another land.}}
# [[because]], for such a reason
#: {{usex|unm|Ku nuwatuu '''wënchi'''.|I do not know '''why'''.}}
#: {{usex|unm|Nal në '''wënchi''' yukwe mèchi nhakatàmëneyo.|That is '''the reason why''' they still use it.}}

===Preverb===
{{head|unm|preverb|1st person|nëwënchi|2nd person|kwënchi|3rd person|wënchi}}

