Page 1247 wëshkinkw: -------- begin text --------

===Alternative forms===
* /[[-inkw-]]/ in compounds

===Etymology===
* /[[w-]]/ ''([[prefix]])'': third person prefix
* /[[ëshkinkw]]/ ''([[stem]])'': face

* Literally ''his face''. the stem ''-ëshkinkw-'' is a bound or 'dependent' lemma, which can only appear in compounds with affixes.

===Noun===
{{head|unm|noun|plural|wëshkinko|locative|wëshkinkunk|possessed|[[nëshkinkw]]/[[nëwëshkinkw]]|g=in}}

# [[eye]], [[face]]
