{{unm-pos-blank|[[nëshkinkw]]/[[nëwëshkinkw]]|këshkinkw|wëshkinkw/[[ushkinkëm]]||||}}

====Usage notes====
Dependent noun stems cannot be used without prefixes or suffixes.

